WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:19.270
So... The soldiers called the Rain 
surround this giant thing.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.500
And here's the plan.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.680
Shichigen and Rui go around, to the 
back, to draw them away.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:32.300
While they do,

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:37.920
Saizou, Utsutsu, and Shikibu take 
out the Murakumo's cannons.

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:40.760
They'll throw explosives into the cannon ports.

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.420
If it works...

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:36.090
<b><i>The Wind Blows Through the Pines</i></b>

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:40.760
Hachirou is here?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.510
Yes. I'm sure of it.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:47.020
I didn't see him, but if you say so...

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.890
I think so, too.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.110
Hibiki, do you also want to go?

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.820
They've already come after this place once.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:01.030
It's actually more dangerous 
for her to stay here.

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.120
Yeah.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.140
Hachisu, don't forget Gorouza.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.540
Hey, Gorone...

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:10.890
Hachisu is correct.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.250
We cannot assume it's safe here.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.300
We'll use everything we have.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:21.460
Once the new Saibougu is tuned up, we leave.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.440
Wait!

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.690
Let's go, Shichigen.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.760
We need to get there soon.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.090
Before autumn ends.

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:19.540
Can you see them?

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:22.500
Seven, eight, nine...

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.610
I can see at least ten.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:26.840
Let's go.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:31.000
Just as planned, we'll draw the Rain away.

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:34.120
If it works, I'll give the signal.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.260
Until then...

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.450
I know.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.000
Shikibu...

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:48.020
Your saying about the rhinoceros 
continues past what you quoted.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:54.140
"For a sociable person, there is affection;

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:58.150
on the heels of affection comes this pain.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.150
Seeing affection's perils,

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:05.920
wander alone, like a rhinoceros."

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.780
Does that mean...

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.040
Hibiki, you think the same?

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.750
It seems to be referring to the Ouka.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:26.940
If the two of you created that technique,

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:30.280
you and Hachirou can change it.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:39.910
If loving and caring for another 
created a ninja technique,

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:44.170
then will the Ouka truly bring 
nothing but misery?

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.340
Can we reach them at this range?

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.000
We're upwind, fortunately.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.030
It'll be fine.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.210
Once you use your technique, 
fall back immediately.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.740
I'll take over.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:18.730
Right.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.630
Riflemen?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.210
The Rain has riflemen?

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.570
The ones who attacked us were decoys?

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:13.500
We intended to lure them out, 
but instead, they lured us in...

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.970
I didn't smell the gunpowder.

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.130
That's why they waited downwind.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.450
We can't count on Saizou's eyeballs, either.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:26.400
I had no idea the Rain were even there.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:28.730
You're...

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:33.740
Yeah, they got me in the left thigh.

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:42.520
I know that autumn can be a painful thing,

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.540
but I shall never tire

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.030
of the sound of the bell crickets.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.620
Now... Help me walk.

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:08.650
Did they leave?

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:09.630
I guess.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:12.860
Where's the bullet?

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.760
It went clean through, I think.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.770
It was just a graze...

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.950
I pray to Avalokiteśvara 
and petition her aid.

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:43.870
I pray to Avalokiteśvara 
and petition her aid.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.430
I pray to Avalokiteśvara 
and petition her aid.

00:10:48.970 --> 00:10:52.380
What did you pray to Avalokiteśvara for?

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.770
That she would watch over this journey.

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:57.970
And...

00:10:58.860 --> 00:10:59.990
And?

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:08.980
That autumn... would never end.

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.160
Are you cold?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:15.960
No.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:19.850
But your arms and legs are so cold.

00:11:20.390 --> 00:11:21.910
I'm fine.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.270
I, Shichigen, am the child of a samurai.

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:25.720
I see.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.920
"I know that autumn can be a painful thing,

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:36.470
but I shall never tire of the 
sound of the bell crickets."

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:42.560
You love that poem, don't you, Mother?

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.830
I suppose I do.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:55.190
An acquaintance of your father's is 
staying in Kouga until autumn.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:58.660
He has connections to Kishuu Domain.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.700
And if we can meet him,

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.330
perhaps you can be an officer, someday.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.510
Watch this, Mother.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.720
Wow, Shichigen!

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.980
No, it didn't work.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:47.240
I tried to silence them for longer.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.180
It seems like it worked to me!

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:52.120
To be able to do such a thing, 
even for an instant...

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:56.750
Perhaps it's your bloodline, 
you and your father's...

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.400
Father? My father can control insects, too?

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:01.450
Yes...

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.420
It's quiet again.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:02.400
No one said anything about 
them having rifles.

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.930
Let's hurry, Shikibu.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.430
No need to tell me twice.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.740
Well, can you see anything?

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.890
Nothing's moving anywhere.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:18.220
What were those fires we saw, then?

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:19.790
Are Rui and Shichigen all right?

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.620
Calm down, damn it.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:23.800
Wait for the signal.

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.190
Fool.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.260
Shichigen!

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:55.760
Stupid brat...

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.510
I won't hold back any more!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.420
You should be more forgiving of children.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:16.530
Please forgive him.

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.040
Who... are you?

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:24.180
Merely a traveling woman.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:27.900
Very well.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:19.970
My father was a ninja.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:21.220
What?

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:24.730
Did you dream of something 
while you were passed out?

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.930
Maybe...

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:30.620
I heard you were from a 
samurai family, anyway.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.220
That was what my mother said.

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:34.750
Let's go.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:35.990
Yeah.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:42.490
<i>And she even had ninja techniques,</i>

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.960
<i>which she used to save me.</i>

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.910
<i>And all I could do was slow her down.</i>

00:17:57.200 --> 00:17:57.950
Rifles!

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.670
An ambush?

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:07.270
Seems so.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.800
But that's fine.

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:12.190
It means they're coming after us...

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:15.030
Because they haven't noticed Saizou's group.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.400
We've achieved our objective.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.140
How can you be so calm?

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:25.040
They're upwind, knowing that 
we'll smell their gunpowder.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.450
They're worried about your technique.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:29.300
They won't get close.

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:32.040
We can't use your butterflies.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.140
I'll buy you time.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.550
While I do, run.

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:39.210
Shichigen!

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:45.310
I'll never let anyone else pay 
the price for my failure.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:49.060
Who's there?

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.600
Don't be in such a hurry, Shichigen.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:18:59.570
Hachirou...

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.570
You came to save us!

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.580
You've decided to help us?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.850
I've come to avenge the Five Treasures.

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:10.790
That's all.

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.400
You haven't changed...

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:16.550
Well, either way,

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.470
we must get through this, first.

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:22.220
Shichigen, help me with your technique.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:29.820
At this range and in this darkness, 
I can't use my eye magic.

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.690
Unless I can get closer.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.650
So, when you summon the insects, 
I'll go with them to get close.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:36.820
Your eye magic is as impressive as ever.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:39.120
As is Shichigen's technique.

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:45.180
Very few ninjas achieve his level 
of mastery over insects.

00:20:58.990 --> 00:21:02.810
I named the technique 
"Wind Through the Pines."

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.230
The wind that blows through the pines...

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.290
<i>I know that autumn can be a painful thing,</i>

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.910
<i>but I shall never tire of the 
sound of the bell crickets.</i>

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.220
<i>I know...</i>

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.470
<i>that autumn can be a painful thing,</i>

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:36.980
<i>but I shall never tire</i>

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:39.600
<i>of the sound... of the bell crickets.</i>

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:43.190
<i>Can you hear it, Mother?</i>

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.990
<i>The bell crickets are still crying.</i>

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:47.320
Let's go...

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:49.960
Let's go together, Mother.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:54.120
Autumn isn't over yet.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.970
A father risked his life,

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:30.570
praying that his daughter would 
master her technique.

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:35.050
But the young girl has no way 
to know how he felt.

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:38.520
<b><i>Utsutsu Dreams of Hell</i></b>

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:39.270
You would name this useless technique 
"Dreaming Wakefulness"?
